   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">It looks like fastICA requires R 3.0.0, but glimmer has 2.15.3 installed. You may be able to install an older version by using a procedure like the one here:<div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/oCuqVlXndgA/odc1QFLFX1gJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/oCuqVlXndgA/odc1QFLFX1gJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406548253000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZG59gdKJhvdSOMH8LVO6o\">https://groups.google.com/d/msg/shiny-discuss/oCuqVlXndgA/odc1QFLFX1gJ</a><br>\r\n\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>To find the file to download, see the &quot;Old sources&quot; link here:</div><div><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/fastICA/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/fastICA/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406548253000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3DZSQaiynHfJ186jOZr5sA\">http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/fastICA/index.html</a><br>\r\n\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>-Winston</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Jun 18, 2013 at 12:39 AM, Stéphane Laurent <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lauren...@yahoo.fr</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n</div></div>"
