     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you very much. This works very well:<div><br></div><div><div><i>download.file(&#39;<a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/fastICA/fastICA_1.1-16.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/fastICA/fastICA_1.1-16.tar.gz&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792406548256000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3EXOyKj3N4h5lvB0jQVY7m\">http://cran.r-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/fastICA/fastICA_1.1-16.tar.gz</a>&#39;,</i></div><div><i>              destfile=&#39;fastICA_1.1-16.tar.gz&#39;)</i></div><div><i>install.packages(&#39;fastICA_1.1-16.tar.gz&#39;, type=&#39;source&#39;, repos=NULL)</i></div><div><i>unlink(&#39;fastICA_1.1-16.tar.gz&#39;)</i></div></div></div>"
    ],
